Bagging Vs Boosting:

Bagging:

1. Decision Tree and Random Forest
2. parallel process
3. all the tress will be evaluated all at once.


Boosting:

1. Ada Boosting, XG Boosting, Gradient Boosting
2. Series process
3. all the trees will be evaluated one after the another
4. So error in the previous tree can be used for better
learning of the next tree.

Both we called as "Ensemble Method" (Assembly)
